{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a8738273f2b327788c6c7ea0939c303da24c2ea38a099d8f42a51520825df8c4", "ja": "（秋がテーマのイベントに参加してから数日後。\nどうやらエレナは、料理にハマっているらしい……）", "zh": "（参加以秋天为主题的活动后过了几天。看来艾蕾娜好像迷上了做菜……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "ab42fcfd13ad85deaca9cb8f814e3846d341d446a71cd98e43dad15bfac46ae9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n探してたヨー！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n我正找你呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d3af2ffb0f39d237eeea44c9edef24d5280bc76005304380489cf61bba4028d3", "ja": "エレナ、お疲れ様。\n探してたって、何かあったのか？", "zh": "艾莲娜，辛苦了。\n你说在找我，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "01121794812134de696d9ce059a6eba3e66255f2fcba9f257a0cc4c795d1f62c", "ja": "うん！　あのネ……\n{$P$}の好きな料理、教えて？", "zh": "嗯！那个呢……\n能告诉我{$P$}喜欢吃什么菜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "2f5c716b7dd664396618504e0455f27c84baaea847ee63b4ea77d66542149286", "ja": "今、みんなに好きな料理を聞いてるノ！\n大好物の料理があったら、みんなうれしいでしょ？", "zh": "我现在正在问大家喜欢吃什么菜呢！\n要是有特别喜欢的菜，大家都会很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1005_p", "source_sha256": "506dcab5b181a88a3808986de26f43c22753037ef0e14e3c5bf6945a4e9c4720", "ja": "そうだったのか。好きな料理……あっ！\nイベントでエレナが作ったグラタンは美味しかったな。", "zh": "原来是这样。喜欢的料理……啊！\n活动中艾蕾娜做的焗烤很好吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "a8330c1fb151dd1782d9f6232d76441ecfcda8a9a60156ecc4f77a07785456dd", "ja": "イベントの？　……ああ、さつまいものグラタンだネ！\nエヘヘ、気に入ってくれてうれしいナ～♪", "zh": "活动上的？……啊，是红薯焗烤呀！\n嘿嘿，你喜欢我做的菜，我很开心哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "9d1d45715785b38084ecb9a44ab2e4c3d541dd587a62c49c64c65cf318428565", "ja": "じゃあ、ひとつはグラタンで決定～！　うーん……\nでもなんか物足りないカモ？　他には……。", "zh": "那就决定其中一个是焗烤了～！嗯……\n不过总觉得好像还差点什么？还有别的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1008_p", "source_sha256": "430b5a6a39d6d9de5c115462fea1420046666dab621e9803d463c9073725d5ba", "ja": "あの、エレナ……。\n真剣に悩んでるところ、ごめん。", "zh": "那个，艾莲娜……\n看你这么认真在纠结，不好意思打扰了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "3219249263a576411e61b9f38cc89f7a9a6247c279567d598106c99d876cbb74", "ja": "どうしたノ、{$P$}？\nも、もしかして……ワタシの料理食べたくない？", "zh": "怎么了呀，{$P$}？\n难、难道说……你不想吃我做的饭？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1010_p", "source_sha256": "5202a4bb8a4777f991ad6d3743c9adc26860408d8771789b9e2676e199699c5e", "ja": "いや、そんなことはないよ。\nただ……食欲の秋で、最近ご飯が美味しくて……。", "zh": "不是，没那回事啦。\n只是……正赶上食欲之秋，最近吃什么都觉得香……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "285fb4e1523c49bd63cabe9984d469645e223a7f980efd350e8312677f3040b9", "ja": "それなら、心配しなくてもダイジョーブ♪\nいっぱい食べた後は、いーっぱい踊ればいいんだヨ！", "zh": "这样的话，不用担心啦♪\n吃饱之后，再尽情跳舞就好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "2a304f9c4ddcbb2e41af235a5dabb54fe6cc609327597414424abbcd8bbc5bad", "ja": "ママンがよく言ってるヨ？\nカーニバルは「お肉バイバイ」って意味なんだって。", "zh": "妈妈经常这么说哦？\n听说嘉年华的意思就是“和肉肉说拜拜”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0970cf6265243107ff9d823553cf6aebc42cd7578edb76ce1e8912a7bba18570", "ja": "お肉バイバイ？　たしか、カーニバルの語源に\n「肉を絶つ」とかなんとか……。", "zh": "告别肉类？我记得，狂欢节的词源好像是“戒肉”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "72baa6d3871ef601fab7d08b42d49a87aee2eb17c0d3021c816d199de8836e6b", "ja": "そうそう！　それに、みんなで体を動かしたら\nとーっても気持ちがいいと思うノ！", "zh": "对呀对呀！而且，大家要是能一起活动身体的话，\n一定会超级超级舒服的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1015_p", "source_sha256": "afa17ba8d2a3468d53500706f6d0959c9d8c54c0453ba3ed5ab3a0a5b52d7d5c", "ja": "なるほど。食欲の秋と運動の秋……両方を楽しめる\nってわけか。そういうことなら安心だな！", "zh": "原来如此。既能享受食欲之秋，又能享受运动之秋……也就是说，两边都能尽情享受。这样的话我就放心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0343_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0343_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "90b96a519a7b90eff76538defd5d3e233bf8ed1f96737b91f66a340c72d8f738", "ja": "でしょ？　料理たーくさん用意するから、\nみんなで秋を満喫しようネ♪", "zh": "对吧？我会准备好多好多料理，大家一起尽情享受秋天吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
